sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant AI as User's AI assistant
    participant MCP as MCP server
    participant Fn as save-plan function
    participant DB as Database
    participant App as Mobile app
    User->>AI: "Make me a plan for this week"
    AI->>MCP: get_workouts, get_goals, get_progress
    MCP->>DB: Read permitted data with the user's login
    DB-->>MCP: Recent workouts, goals, schedule, streak
    MCP-->>AI: Data summary
    Note over AI: Writes the plan and<br/>explains the advice to the user
    AI->>MCP: create_workout_plan(days, workouts, minutes)
    MCP->>Fn: Plan request
    Note over Fn: Safety checks: plan permission on,<br/>safe ranges, no medical claims
    alt Plan passes checks
        Fn->>DB: Save plan with status "suggested"<br/>and created_by "assistant"
        Fn-->>MCP: Plan saved
        MCP-->>AI: Success
        App-->>User: "Your assistant suggested a plan"
        User->>App: Accept, edit, or dismiss
        App->>DB: Update plan status
    else Plan fails checks
        Fn-->>MCP: Rejected, with the reason
        MCP-->>AI: Error the assistant can fix and retry
    end
